WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.160
What about your position coach?

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.320
My position coach was Jerry Stovall.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.460
Jerry Stovall was also the guy that recruited me out of Galveston [Texas] ball.

4
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.380
Real tough guy.

5
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.260
Tough is the word I guess you could use with Jerry Stovall.

6
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:20.920
I just remember that he would never . . . He would always demand the very best out of you.

7
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:26.180
You would leave nothing on the field as far as games or at practice, just demanded a lot out of you.

8
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.840
As long as you gave him your very best, he was okay.

9
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.700
But, if you didn’t, he had trouble with you, or you had trouble with him.

10
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.920
Did the coaches get involved in the academic side of a player’s life?

11
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:46.060
Yes, we . . . One thing Coach Stovall did is at the beginning of each year, we would fill out a goal sheet.

12
00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.600
We’d write down our goals for each year.

13
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.220
They always say if you write something down,

14
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:58.660
ninety-nine percent of the time or ninety-five percent of the time those goals are going to come true or you’re going to come close to accomplishing those goals.

15
00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.460
We would do that every year and it would be amazing when you look at those goals.

16
00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:06.600
At the end of the year, you had come pretty close to achieving those goals.

17
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:07.644
I know I did.

18
00:01:07.644 --> 00:01:09.860
Is that something that has stuck with you?

19
00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:10.660
Yeah, yeah it does.

20
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.400
That’s what I got my book right on the side of me now.

21
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.620
I’ve every . . . At the beginning of each year,

22
00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.960
I’ll sit down and I’ll write things down, “Well, I want to do this in 1993.”

23
00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.740
I’ll just put those goals down and most of the time, I accomplish them.
